{%- comment -%}
BLACK WEEK · outputs CSS classes that show an element only in the given phases.
Usage: <div class="{% render 'bw-only', phases: 'pre' %}"> · phases: space/comma separated list of pre, early, live, sidste, ended
(ended = after mandag 30.11 kl. 23:59; anything with a phase list is hidden then unless it lists ended).
Empty phases = always shown.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bw_list = phases | default: '' | replace: ',', ' ' | split: ' '
  assign bw_all = 'pre,early,live,sidste,ended' | split: ','
  if bw_list.size > 0
    for bw_p in bw_all
      unless bw_list contains bw_p
        echo ' bw-hide-' | append: bw_p
      endunless
    endfor
  endif
-%}
